{
  "_comment": "Seccomp allowlist for JA4proxy TAP sensor — Go binary (Phase 244).",
  "_description": "Restricts the TAP sensor to only required syscalls. Derived from proxy.json with AF_PACKET additions. No fork/exec/ptrace. Applied in-process via raw BPF (CGO_ENABLED=0 compatible).",
